# Poimandres IDE – The Techne Tablets

**An open-source sacred interface for the unification of code, consciousness, and creativity.**

Inspired by Jupyter Notebooks, but expanded beyond. This is a place where coders, philosophers, mystics, scientists, and visionaries can invoke logic, build worlds, and compose living knowledge.

## Vision
> “As above, so below. As in thought, so in code.”

Poimandres IDE is a modular, cross-platform coding grimoire that fuses live code, mystical design, visual debugging, AI-guided logic, and executable builds into a sacred text editor for the next generation of creators.

## Key Features
- Live multi-language code cells (Python, Java, JS, Bash)
- One-click JAR and APK compilation
- Visual debugger with mystical glyphs
- AI Daemon Assistant (Thoth-like support module)
- Glyphgraph builder for node-based logic prototyping
- Notebook + Markdown + diagram fusion
- Modular "Tablet Plugins" and shared Scroll Libraries

## Branches
- `main` – Stable release
- `dev` – Active development
- `ui-layout-codex` – Tailwind + React layout engine
- `cell-engine` – Core code cell executor
- `build-alchemy` – JAR/APK/Prototype packaging
- `ai-daemon` – Embedded GPT-style assistant
- `hermetic-debugger` – Visual logic step-through system
- `glyph-visualizer` – Code-to-glyph mapping
- `techne-docs` – Vision, manifesto, contributing guides
- `scroll-library` – User-shared notebooks, poems, and spells

## Philosophy
Poimandres IDE is a temple of thought. Every line of code is an invocation. Every function is a rune. Every application is a creation spell.

